Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:14:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] analysis/sea_ice_observations.jl: sea ice against NOAA/NSIDC
 satellite concentration

Criterion 4 of #15. For a period of a run (default the whole run), one daily mean every n days of the model's sea-ice
concentration against the NOAA/NSIDC CDR daily passive-microwave concentration (25 km, from NCEI's THREDDS server,
downloaded once), mapped onto the model's columns by the product's polar-stereographic projection and checked against
the file's latitudes. Extent and area by region (the regions of sea_ice_comparison.jl) on the same valid columns;
monthly table for the whole domain; extent time series and concentration maps (mid-March, mid-September). CPU only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
